\p \v 13 \w After this, Gideon|strong="H1439"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Joash|strong="H3101"\w* \w returned|strong="H7725"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the battle|strong="H4421"\w* \w along the Ascent of|strong="H4608"\w* \w Heres|strong="H2776"\w*. \v 14 \w There he captured|strong="H3920"\w* \w a young man|strong="H5288"\w* \w . . .|strong="H582"\w* \w of Succoth|strong="H5523"\w* \w and interrogated him|strong="H7592"\w*. \w The young man wrote down|strong="H3789"\w* \w for him|strong="H413"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w the names of the seventy-seven|strong="H7657"\w* \w . . .|strong="H7651"\w* \w -|strong="H376"\w* \w leaders|strong="H8269"\w* \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w elders|strong="H2205"\w* \w of Succoth|strong="H5523"\w*.
\p \v 15 \w And [Gideon] went|strong="H935"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the men|strong="H582"\w* \w of Succoth|strong="H5523"\w* \w and said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Here|strong="H2009"\w* \w are Zebah|strong="H2078"\w* \w and Zalmunna|strong="H6759"\w*, \w about whom|strong="H834"\w* \w you taunted|strong="H2778"\w* \w me|strong="H853"\w*, \w saying|strong="H559"\w*, ‘\w [Are] the hands|strong="H3709"\w* \w of Zebah|strong="H2078"\w* \w and Zalmunna|strong="H6759"\w* \w already|strong="H6258"\w* \w in your possession|strong="H3027"\w*, \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w we should give|strong="H5414"\w* \w bread|strong="H3899"\w* \w to your weary|strong="H3287"\w* \w men|strong="H582"\w*?’” \v 16 \w Then he took|strong="H3947"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w the elders|strong="H2205"\w* \w of the city|strong="H5892"\w*, \w and [using]|strong="H853"\w* \w the thorns|strong="H6975"\w* \w and briers|strong="H1303"\w* \w of the wilderness|strong="H4057"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* -, \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w he disciplined|strong="H3045"\w* \w the men|strong="H582"\w* \w of Succoth|strong="H5523"\w*. \v 17 \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w He also pulled down|strong="H5422"\w* \w the tower|strong="H4026"\w* \w of Penuel|strong="H6439"\w* \w and killed|strong="H2026"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w the men|strong="H582"\w* \w of the city|strong="H5892"\w*.
\p \v 18 \w Next, [Gideon] asked|strong="H559"\w* \w . . .|strong="H413"\w* \w Zebah|strong="H2078"\w* \w . . .|strong="H413"\w* \w and Zalmunna|strong="H6759"\w*, “\w What kind|strong="H375"\w* \w of men|strong="H582"\w* \w -|strong="H834"\w* \w did you kill|strong="H2026"\w* \w at Tabor|strong="H8396"\w*?”
\p “\w Men like you|strong="H3644"\w*,” \w . . .|strong="H3644"\w* \w they answered|strong="H559"\w*, “\w [each] one|strong="H259"\w* \w resembling|strong="H8389"\w* \w the son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of a king|strong="H4428"\w*.”
