\p \v 18 \w Before|strong="H2962"\w* \w sunset|strong="H935"\w* \w . . .|strong="H2775"\w* \w on the seventh|strong="H7637"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w*, \w the men|strong="H582"\w* \w of the city|strong="H5892"\w* \w said|strong="H559"\w* to [Samson]:
