\c 15
\s1 Samson’s Revenge
\p \v 1 \w Later on|strong="H1961"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3117"\w*, \w at the time|strong="H3117"\w* \w of the wheat|strong="H2406"\w* \w harvest|strong="H7105"\w*, \w Samson|strong="H8123"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w took|strong="H1423"\w* \w a young goat|strong="H5795"\w* \w and went to visit|strong="H6485"\w* \w his wife|strong="H802"\w*. “\w I want to go|strong="H935"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w my wife|strong="H802"\w* \w in her room|strong="H2315"\w*,” \w he said|strong="H559"\w*. \w But her father|strong="H1"\w* \w would not|strong="H3808"\w* \w let him|strong="H5414"\w* \w enter|strong="H935"\w*.
\p \v 2 “\w I was sure|strong="H559"\w* \w . . .|strong="H559"\w* \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w you thoroughly hated her|strong="H8130"\w* \w . . .|strong="H8130"\w*,” \w said|strong="H559"\w* \w her father|strong="H1"\w*, “\w so I gave her|strong="H5414"\w* \w to one of the men who accompanied you|strong="H4828"\w*. \w Is not|strong="H3808"\w* \w her younger|strong="H6996"\w* \w sister|strong="H269"\w* \w more beautiful|strong="H2896"\w* \w than she|strong="H4480"\w*? \w Please|strong="H4994"\w* \w take her|strong="H1961"\w* \w instead|strong="H8478"\w*.”
