\p \w So the Philistines|strong="H6430"\w* \w went up|strong="H5927"\w* \w and burned|strong="H8313"\w* \w her and her father|strong="H1"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w to death|strong="H784"\w*.
\p \v 7 \w And Samson|strong="H8123"\w* \w told|strong="H559"\w* them, “\w Because|strong="H518"\w* \w you have done|strong="H6213"\w* \w this|strong="H2063"\w*, \w I will not rest|strong="H2308"\w* \w until|strong="H3588"\w* \w . . .|strong="H518"\w* \w I have taken vengeance|strong="H5358"\w* upon you \w -|strong="H310"\w*.” \v 8 \w And he struck|strong="H5221"\w* \w them|strong="H853"\w* \w ruthlessly|strong="H7785"\w* \w . . .|strong="H5921"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3409"\w*\f + \fr 15:8 \ft Literally \fqa he struck them hip and thigh\f* \w with a great|strong="H1419"\w* \w slaughter|strong="H4347"\w*, \w and then went down|strong="H3381"\w* \w and stayed|strong="H3427"\w* \w in the cave|strong="H5585"\w* \w at the rock|strong="H5553"\w* \w of Etam|strong="H5862"\w*.
