\p \v 17 \w And|strong="H1961"\w* \w when [Samson] had finished|strong="H3615"\w* \w speaking|strong="H1696"\w*, \w he cast|strong="H7993"\w* \w the jawbone|strong="H3895"\w* \w from his hand|strong="H3027"\w*; \w and he named|strong="H7121"\w* \w that|strong="H1931"\w* \w place|strong="H4725"\w* \w vvv|strong="H7437"\w* \w Ramath-lehi|strong="H7437"\w*.\f + \fr 15:17 \fqa Ramath-lehi \ft means \fqa the hill of the jawbone\ft .\f*
