\c 16
\s1 Samson Escapes Gaza
\p \v 1 \w One day Samson|strong="H8123"\w* \w went|strong="H1980"\w* \w to Gaza|strong="H5804"\w*, \w where|strong="H8033"\w* \w . . .|strong="H802"\w* \w he saw|strong="H7200"\w* \w a prostitute|strong="H2181"\w* \w and went in to spend the night|strong="H935"\w* \w with her|strong="H413"\w*.
