\s1 Samson and Delilah
\p \v 4 \w -|strong="H1961"\w* \w Some time later|strong="H310"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3651"\w*, \w [Samson] fell in love with|strong="H157"\w* \w a woman|strong="H802"\w* \w in the Valley|strong="H5158"\w* \w of Sorek|strong="H7796"\w*, \w whose name|strong="H8034"\w* \w was Delilah|strong="H1807"\w*. \v 5 \w The lords|strong="H5633"\w* \w of the Philistines|strong="H6430"\w* \w went|strong="H5927"\w* \w to her|strong="H413"\w* \w and said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Entice|strong="H6601"\w* \w him|strong="H853"\w* \w and find out|strong="H7200"\w* \w the source of|strong="H4100"\w* \w his great|strong="H1419"\w* \w strength|strong="H3581"\w* \w and how|strong="H4100"\w* \w we can overpower|strong="H3201"\w* him \w to tie him up|strong="H631"\w* \w and subdue him|strong="H6031"\w*. \w Then each one|strong="H376"\w* \w of us|strong="H587"\w* \w will give|strong="H5414"\w* you \w eleven hundred [shekels]|strong="H505"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3967"\w* \w of silver|strong="H3701"\w*.\f + \fr 16:5 \fqa \ref 1,100|0\ref* shekels\ft is \ref approximately 27|27\ref*.6 pounds or 12.5 kilograms of silver.\f*”
