\s1 The Danites Settle in Laish
\p \v 1 \w In those|strong="H1992"\w* \w days|strong="H3117"\w* \w there was no|strong="H369"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w in Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w [and]|strong="H3117"\w* \w . . .|strong="H1992"\w* \w the tribe|strong="H7626"\w* \w of the Danites|strong="H1839"\w* \w was looking for|strong="H1245"\w* - \w territory|strong="H5159"\w* \w to occupy|strong="H3427"\w*. \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w up to|strong="H5704"\w* \w that|strong="H1931"\w* \w time|strong="H3117"\w* \w they had not|strong="H3808"\w* \w come into|strong="H5307"\w* - \w an inheritance|strong="H5159"\w* \w among|strong="H8432"\w* \w the tribes|strong="H7626"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*. \v 2 \w So the Danites|strong="H1121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H1835"\w* \w sent out|strong="H7971"\w* \w five|strong="H2568"\w* \w men|strong="H582"\w* \w from their clans|strong="H4940"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H7098"\w* \w men|strong="H582"\w* \w of|strong="H1121"\w* \w valor|strong="H2428"\w* \w from Zorah|strong="H6881"\w* \w and Eshtaol|strong="H847"\w*, \w to spy out|strong="H7270"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w the land|strong="H776"\w* \w and explore it|strong="H2713"\w*. “\w Go|strong="H1980"\w* \w and explore|strong="H2713"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w the land|strong="H776"\w*,” \w they told them|strong="H559"\w* \w . . .|strong="H413"\w*.
