\p \w When the Benjamites|strong="H1144"\w* \w had begun|strong="H2490"\w* \w to strike them down|strong="H5221"\w*, \w killing|strong="H2491"\w* \w about thirty|strong="H7970"\w* \w . . .|strong="H376"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3588"\w* \w men|strong="H376"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*, \w they said|strong="H559"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H389"\w* “\w They are|strong="H1931"\w* \w defeated|strong="H5062"\w* \w . . .|strong="H5062"\w* \w before us|strong="H6440"\w* \w as in the first|strong="H7223"\w* \w battle|strong="H4421"\w*.” \v 40 \w -|strong="H4864"\w* \w But when the column|strong="H5982"\w* \w of smoke|strong="H6227"\w* \w began|strong="H2490"\w* \w to go up|strong="H5927"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the city|strong="H5892"\w*, \w the Benjamites|strong="H1144"\w* \w looked|strong="H6437"\w* \w behind them|strong="H310"\w* \w and saw|strong="H2009"\w* \w the whole|strong="H3632"\w* \w city|strong="H5892"\w* \w going up|strong="H5927"\w* \w in smoke|strong="H8064"\w*.
