\p \v 13 \w Then the whole|strong="H3605"\w* \w congregation|strong="H5712"\w* \w sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w a message|strong="H1696"\w* \w . . .|strong="H7121"\w* - \w of peace|strong="H7965"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the Benjamites|strong="H1121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H1144"\w* \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w were at the rock|strong="H5553"\w* \w of Rimmon|strong="H7417"\w*. \v 14 \w And at that|strong="H1931"\w* \w time|strong="H6256"\w* \w the Benjamites|strong="H1144"\w* \w returned|strong="H7725"\w* \w and were given|strong="H5414"\w* - \w the women|strong="H802"\w* \w -|strong="H834"\w* \w who were spared|strong="H2421"\w* \w . . .|strong="H802"\w* \w from Jabesh-gilead|strong="H3003"\w* \w . . .|strong="H1568"\w*. \w But there were not|strong="H3808"\w* \w . . .|strong="H4672"\w* \w enough [women]|strong="H3651"\w* for all of them.
\p \v 15 \w The people|strong="H5971"\w* \w grieved|strong="H5162"\w* \w for Benjamin|strong="H1144"\w*, \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w had made|strong="H6213"\w* \w a void|strong="H6556"\w* \w in the tribes|strong="H7626"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*.
\p \v 16 \w Then the elders|strong="H2205"\w* \w of the congregation|strong="H5712"\w* \w said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w What|strong="H4100"\w* \w should we do|strong="H6213"\w* \w about wives|strong="H802"\w* \w for those who remain|strong="H3498"\w*, \w since|strong="H3588"\w* \w the women|strong="H802"\w* \w of Benjamin|strong="H1144"\w* \w have been destroyed|strong="H8045"\w*?” \v 17 \w They added|strong="H559"\w*, “\w There must be heirs|strong="H3425"\w* \w for the survivors|strong="H6413"\w* \w of Benjamin|strong="H1144"\w*, \w so that a tribe|strong="H7626"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w will not|strong="H3808"\w* \w be wiped out|strong="H4229"\w*. \v 18 \w But we|strong="H587"\w* \w cannot|strong="H3808"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3201"\w* \w give|strong="H5414"\w* them \w our daughters|strong="H1323"\w* \w as wives|strong="H802"\w*.”
\p \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w the Israelites|strong="H1121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3478"\w* \w . . .|strong="H559"\w* \w had sworn|strong="H7650"\w*, “\w Cursed is|strong="H779"\w* \w he who gives|strong="H5414"\w* \w a wife|strong="H802"\w* \w to a Benjamite|strong="H1144"\w*.”
\p \v 19 “\w But look|strong="H2009"\w*,” \w they said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w there is a yearly|strong="H3117"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3117"\w* \w feast|strong="H2282"\w* \w to the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w in Shiloh|strong="H7887"\w*, \w which [is]|strong="H834"\w* \w north|strong="H6828"\w* \w vvv|strong="H1008"\w* \w of Bethel|strong="H1008"\w* \w vvv|strong="H4217"\w* \w east|strong="H8121"\w* \w of the road|strong="H4546"\w* \w that goes up|strong="H5927"\w* \w from|strong="H1008"\w* \w Bethel|strong="H1008"\w* \w to Shechem|strong="H7927"\w*, \w and south|strong="H5045"\w* \w of Lebonah|strong="H3829"\w*.”
\p \v 20 \w So they commanded|strong="H6680"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w the Benjamites|strong="H1121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H1144"\w*: \w . . .|strong="H559"\w* “\w Go|strong="H1980"\w*, \w hide|strong="H693"\w* \w in the vineyards|strong="H3754"\w* \v 21 \w and watch|strong="H7200"\w*. \w When|strong="H518"\w* \w you see|strong="H2009"\w* \w the daughters|strong="H1323"\w* \w of Shiloh|strong="H7887"\w* \w come out|strong="H3318"\w* \w to perform|strong="H2342"\w* \w their dances|strong="H4246"\w*, \w each of you|strong="H376"\w* \w is to come out|strong="H3318"\w* \w of the vineyards|strong="H3754"\w*, \w catch|strong="H2414"\w* for himself \w a wife|strong="H802"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the daughters|strong="H1323"\w* \w of Shiloh|strong="H7887"\w*, \w and go|strong="H1980"\w* \w to the land|strong="H776"\w* \w of Benjamin|strong="H1144"\w*. \v 22 \w -|strong="H1961"\w* \w When|strong="H3588"\w* \w their fathers|strong="H1"\w* \w or|strong="H176"\w* \w brothers|strong="H251"\w* \w come|strong="H935"\w* \w to us|strong="H413"\w* \w to complain|strong="H7378"\w*, \w we will tell them|strong="H559"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H413"\w* ‘\w Do us a favor|strong="H2603"\w* \w by [helping] them|strong="H853"\w*, \w since|strong="H3588"\w* \w we did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w get|strong="H3947"\w* \w wives|strong="H802"\w* \w for each of them|strong="H376"\w* \w in the war|strong="H4421"\w*. \w Since|strong="H3588"\w* \w you|strong="H859"\w* \w did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w actually|strong="H6256"\w* \w give them|strong="H5414"\w* [your daughters], \w you have no guilt|strong="H816"\w*.’”
\p \v 23 \w The Benjamites|strong="H1121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H1144"\w* \w did|strong="H6213"\w* \w [as instructed]|strong="H3651"\w* \w and carried away|strong="H5375"\w* \w the number|strong="H4557"\w* \w of women|strong="H802"\w* \w they needed from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the dancers|strong="H2342"\w* \w -|strong="H834"\w* \w they caught|strong="H1497"\w*. \w They went|strong="H1980"\w* \w back|strong="H7725"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w their own inheritance|strong="H5159"\w*, \w rebuilt|strong="H1129"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w their cities|strong="H5892"\w*, \w and settled|strong="H3427"\w* in them. \v 24 \w And at that|strong="H1931"\w* \w time|strong="H6256"\w*, \w each|strong="H376"\w* \w vvv|strong="H1121"\w* \w of the Israelites|strong="H3478"\w* \w returned|strong="H1980"\w* \w from there|strong="H8033"\w* \w to his own tribe|strong="H7626"\w* \w and clan|strong="H4940"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H3318"\w* \w each|strong="H376"\w* \w -|strong="H8033"\w* \w to his own inheritance|strong="H5159"\w*.
\p \v 25 \w In those|strong="H1992"\w* \w days|strong="H3117"\w* \w there was no|strong="H369"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w in Israel|strong="H3478"\w*; \w everyone|strong="H376"\w* \w did [what was]|strong="H6213"\w* \w right|strong="H3477"\w* \w in his own eyes|strong="H5869"\w*.
